# Haru, Hidden Talent {1}{G}: "Whenever another Ally you control enters, earthbend 1." Haru is itself an Ally, but "another" keeps its
# own entering from triggering. Invasion Reinforcements enters as an Ally (one earthbend), and its Ally token enters too (a second).
# Bot1's only land is a Forest, so both targets are it: a land that is already a creature is a legal target and gets another +1/+1
# counter, so the Forest ends a 2/2 haste land creature (0/0 and two counters).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Haru, Hidden Talent
Invasion Reinforcements
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

